message: "If you use SAEE, cite it using this metadata. SAEE is an AI agent long-term stability evaluation and decision infrastructure system."
title: "SAEE: AI Agent Long-term Stability Evaluation and Decision Infrastructure System"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Bin
abstract: "SAEE is an AI agent long-term stability evaluation and decision infrastructure system. It provides a public product-facing layer for long-horizon evaluation, multi-agent comparison, failure-mode analysis, survival ranking, and deploy / hold / retest decision support while preserving the project identity of Silicon-Amplified Evolutionary Ecology and the engineering core of the Digital Biosphere Evolution Engine."
